                "markdown": "**Your dependency is vulnerable to [PYSEC-2018-28](https://osv.dev/vulnerability/PYSEC-2018-28)** (Also published as: CVE-2018-18074, GHSA-x84v-xcm2-53pg)."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GHSA-9wx4-h78v-vm56",
              "name": "GHSA-9wx4-h78v-vm56",
              "shortDescription": {
